{"id": "EUVD-2026-103600", "enisaUuid": "bbdbf818-2e0a-353f-b864-3532498bea12", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nllc: fix skb UAF and leaks on llc_mac_hdr_init() failure\n\nIn llc_conn_ac_resend_i_xxx_x_set_0_or_send_rr(), if llc_mac_hdr_init()\nfails, kfree_skb(skb) is called instead of kfree_skb(nskb). This leaks\nthe newly allocated nskb, reads from the freed skb via LLC_I_GET_NR(pdu),\nand double-frees skb when llc_conn_state_process() drops its reference.\n\nIn llc_sap_action_send_xid_r() and llc_sap_action_send_test_r(), nskb is\nleaked if llc_mac_hdr_init() returns an error.\n\nFree nskb in all three error paths.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:18:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:21:38", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fec0fe6838a7f45175667701fb51abb23a6ffb1e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b859ba18b5a1067f71db5618c6a4a70d55fa308b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b855b645841b5a04e20339a22bb6d593c9b790d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d360b31f1a3666579422872aa7d1a751e20b76f9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/060f827aa3dc47939ee306da715cd6700d129616", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/41dcae82bece9f106b4dff0ee777bba8d157c8a8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb3528ad8bb46fa6252f5d14ced7febddc18515d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/72f9dd522f8d6c5a00be9695c7bb74631eb5069e"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98555", "GHSA-q422-9435-7hfq"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0024d665-993b-3d4d-a544-8fd8c3d5f808", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <d360b31f1a3666579422872aa7d1a751e20b76f9"}, {"id": "0233ef76-7888-37e2-b403-4a2c2a315805", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <cb3528ad8bb46fa6252f5d14ced7febddc18515d"}, {"id": "02ae3bad-67d2-3ff4-a7e2-61b4078b230e", "product": {"name